ack for a long time — I like you!\" \"Beryl and Sapphire\" is a popular manhua created by artist Ocarina. Here includes protagonists with the most random names in history — the mild-mannered Beryl (Green) and the easily-embarrassed Sapphire (Blue). At times the closest of friends, at others the worst of enemies… In this donghua where each episode is set in a different world, how would they encounter each other time and again? ? Only angst? Too painful! Nothing but fluff? Too sugary! Come watch B&S, the show where you'll never guess the ending…"},"tags":[{"name":"Episodic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Boys' Love","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Alternate Universe","rank":72,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bisexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Yuri","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gender Bending","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":30,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Lost Civilization","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Xiaolü He Xiaolan","english":null,"native":"小绿和小蓝","romaji":"Xiaolü He Xiaolan","synonyms":[{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Beryl and Sapphire"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"绿蓝"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}